<title>USA: Seagram has no comment on Time Warner.</title>
<headline>Seagram has no comment on Time Warner.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seagram Co Ltd Friday said it had no comment on a television report that it may be seeking to sell a piece of its stake in Time Warner Inc.</p>
<p>CNBC-TV reported that Goldman Sachs was &quot;quietly testing the market's appetite&quot; for Time Warner shares by speaking to portfolio managers.&quot;</p>
<p>According to the March 28 Time Warner proxy, Seagram owns 56.8 million shares, or 11.2 percent of its common stock.</p>
<p>Goldman officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
